\">          onOpenChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{setOpen}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          footer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"outline\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"neutral\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> setOpen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">              收起抽屉</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>遮罩、贴边容器、标题、正文与底部操作区在这一页同时参与基线截图。&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"demo-row\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">SIDES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">              &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"outline\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"neutral\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> setSide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(item)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">                {item}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">              &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>当前方向：{</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">side</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()}&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Drawer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"
